**Formula.** After STAR-ABC at the bottoms and Moh A.3 at internal discs, every vertex is a 3-point cover, so each contributes \(r-3=0\). The residual moduli are the \(k\) bottom nodes on the stable core:

\[
\operatorname{expdim}_A(S,k)=\max(k-2,0).
\]

The Prop 4.6 passport is not a unique numerical profile in the printed text. Reading A (used above) is the A.3 Belyi map, \(r=3\). Reading B takes the squarefree polynomial \(q\) of degree \(Q\) as a generic cover, \(r=Q\), and overcounts if A is right.

**HARD gate passed.** E0 is \(\ge 0\) on all six printed rows (values 0 through 8). The automorphism \((y,x+y^\ell)\) gives 0; the five-disc composition gives 3.

**Trichotomy.** This count cannot prove JC2.

